#import "template.typ": contract
#show: contract.with(
  title: "Amendment No. 1",
  subtitle: "to the Master Services Agreement between Fernway and Quaywise Couriers, dated 15 June 2026",
)

Fernway and Quaywise Couriers agree to change the Master Services Agreement signed on 20 January 2026 as follows, with effect from 1 July 2026.

== Background

Clause 10.1 of the Agreement capped each party's liability at 3 months of Fees. Fernway's vendor policy asks for a cap of at least 12 months of Fees, so the parties raise it to 12 months. Quaywise also starts deliveries in Leipzig.

== 1. Liability

Clause 10.1 is replaced by: "Each party's total liability under this Agreement is limited to the Fees paid or payable in the 12 months before the event that gave rise to the claim."

== 2. Cities

Clause 2.2 is replaced by: "Courier works in Berlin, Hamburg and Leipzig."

== 3. Everything else

All other terms of the Master Services Agreement stay the same.

#v(2em)
Signed for Fernway: Head of Operations #h(1fr) Signed for Courier: Managing Director
